WEBVTT

00:00:30.870 --> 00:00:32.760
Eeehh? A tea party?!

00:00:33.330 --> 00:00:34.500
That’s right.

00:00:41.460 --> 00:00:46.340
My family holds a grand tea party every year.

00:00:46.340 --> 00:00:49.400
If you’d like to, you can attend.

00:00:52.430 --> 00:00:53.530
What’s wrong?

00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:56.470
A tea party...?

00:00:56.470 --> 00:00:57.800
The way you say it...

00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:02.190
You probably just want to have us there
as maids and boss us about!

00:01:02.190 --> 00:01:08.910
Who do you think you are? You don’t have
what it takes to serve our guests.

00:01:11.070 --> 00:01:16.580
Foreign dignitaries, economic leaders, representatives of every sector of society.

00:01:17.040 --> 00:01:20.510
The tea party of the Aizawa family is famous.

00:01:20.920 --> 00:01:22.000
Is that so?

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:25.590
By the way, I’ve already invited Zakuro-oneesama.

00:01:28.010 --> 00:01:29.280
Well Ichigo, you’ve always said...

00:01:29.280 --> 00:01:33.930
...you’d like to meet Nishikawa-kun, from the idol group “Evolution”, right?

00:01:33.930 --> 00:01:35.860
What? Could I meet him?

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:39.370
Yes, they’re invited.

00:01:39.370 --> 00:01:42.020
Really!? Great!

00:01:42.020 --> 00:01:43.370
Ichigo-san!

00:01:43.370 --> 00:01:46.730
Put your thinking cap on.

00:01:46.730 --> 00:01:47.530
What’s wrong?

00:01:47.530 --> 00:01:50.110
This is too good to be true.

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:51.410
What do you mean?

00:01:52.530 --> 00:01:56.800
This is the first time that Minto-oneechan
has done something nice for us.

00:01:57.290 --> 00:01:58.910
Oh, really?

00:01:58.910 --> 00:02:06.250
Yes. She’s good at bossing people around,
but usually she’s not this friendly.

00:02:06.250 --> 00:02:10.380
She must have an ulterior motive for inviting us.

00:02:10.380 --> 00:02:11.570
I wonder...

00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:15.440
I’m sure. She’s definitely plotting something!

00:02:16.050 --> 00:02:20.520
I have an uneasy feeling. That Minto
could be plotting anything...

00:02:20.520 --> 00:02:24.980
Yeah. She’s that Minto, after all.

00:02:24.980 --> 00:02:27.750
What do you mean by
“that” Minto, may I ask?

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:30.690
Well, aha...

00:02:30.690 --> 00:02:34.030
why are you inviting us to such a good party?

00:02:34.030 --> 00:02:35.590
Please tell us.

00:02:36.620 --> 00:02:38.800
Because... well...

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:40.050
Erm...

00:02:44.050 --> 00:02:45.300
Hmm...

00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:53.840
Well I won’t invite you then
if you have objections.

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:56.440
You’re throwing away a precious opportunity to meet Nishikawa-kun!

00:02:58.260 --> 00:02:59.760
It’s Nishikawa-kun!!!

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:02.480
Ahaha.. I’ll go! Please let me go!

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:06.240
Ok, I look forward to
meeting you there!

00:03:35.970 --> 00:03:40.190
S-Somehow I’ve a strong feeling we’re out of place...

00:03:41.260 --> 00:03:45.280
I’ve only seen places like this in the movies and on TV.

00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:47.450
Me too...

00:03:47.940 --> 00:03:50.860
...and look, Minto and Zakuro look fantastic!

00:03:50.860 --> 00:03:51.910
What?

00:03:56.670 --> 00:04:00.970
They both look sophisticated... and Bu-Ling too.

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:07.080
Ignoring Bu-Ling for the moment,

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:11.430
we’ve got to face the fact that we’re just common people here.

00:04:12.300 --> 00:04:14.460
Now I’m a little homesick.

00:04:14.460 --> 00:04:16.050
Yeah.

00:04:16.050 --> 00:04:20.900
I’ll never be able to ask for an autograph
in this mood. Let’s go home.

00:04:38.240 --> 00:04:39.000
That’s...

00:04:42.910 --> 00:04:44.330
What’s that?

00:04:44.330 --> 00:04:46.290
It’s quite cute, isn’t it?

00:04:46.290 --> 00:04:47.970
How tasteless!

00:05:05.770 --> 00:05:08.660
It’s been a long time, Minto-san.

00:05:10.320 --> 00:05:11.160
Who’s she?

00:05:11.770 --> 00:05:14.620
You can’t pretend to forget me.

00:05:14.980 --> 00:05:20.340
You and I are ETERNAL RIVALS!

00:05:21.410 --> 00:05:24.750
Hey, she’s saying you’re her
eternal rival...

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:27.230
I don’t know her.

00:05:27.230 --> 00:05:28.470
Minto says she doesn’t know.

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:35.430
Oh, she’s such a poor liar. Who’d believe
she’d forgot that fateful encounter?

00:05:36.130 --> 00:05:39.440
Excuse me, could you please tell us about the encounter?

00:05:41.470 --> 00:05:46.440
Yes, it was a tea party 7 years ago...

00:05:56.900 --> 00:05:59.380
It’s was a fateful encounter...

00:06:00.610 --> 00:06:02.580
She just passed by!

00:06:03.160 --> 00:06:06.880
Alright. Then I’ll repeat this until you
stop pretending you don’t know me.

00:06:07.290 --> 00:06:08.430
My name is...

00:06:11.960 --> 00:06:14.310
SAIONJI KANNA!

00:06:15.130 --> 00:06:17.310
Saionji Kanna?

00:06:24.090 --> 00:06:26.190
Hey, Minto. Where are you going?

00:06:26.640 --> 00:06:28.600
I’ll leave her up to you.

00:06:28.600 --> 00:06:31.950
It’s a nuisance.
I can’t be bothered with her.

00:06:32.520 --> 00:06:34.600
But what do you want us to do?

00:06:34.600 --> 00:06:39.660
Ah I know! This is why you invited us, right?

00:06:41.190 --> 00:06:43.910
I knew you plotted it!

00:06:43.910 --> 00:06:46.370
No, no. Not for this.

00:06:46.370 --> 00:06:48.340
What are you chatting about?

00:06:48.830 --> 00:06:51.130
Don’t neglect me!

00:06:53.210 --> 00:06:54.890
Are you running away?!

00:06:55.500 --> 00:06:57.470
I just don’t want to get
involved with you.

00:06:57.470 --> 00:07:00.790
I’ve come all this way to settle things with you,

00:07:00.790 --> 00:07:03.050
taking time out from my busy-busy schedule,

00:07:03.050 --> 00:07:06.440
and you say that you don’t want to get involved with me!

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:08.550
I feel unhappy,
quite unhappy about it!

00:07:08.550 --> 00:07:11.560
You of all people should understand.

00:07:11.560 --> 00:07:15.040
Hey, Aizawa Minto!
Now it’s time to duel!

00:07:15.850 --> 00:07:17.650
Duel, duel...

00:07:17.650 --> 00:07:19.440
Why does she want to duel?

00:07:19.440 --> 00:07:21.000
I don’t know.

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:23.280
It’s obvious!

00:07:23.280 --> 00:07:28.450
To make absolutely clear: Me or Ms. Aizawa – who is the most suitable princess?

00:07:28.450 --> 00:07:30.510
In other words,
the fight for princessness!

00:07:35.210 --> 00:07:36.920
She’s laughing wildly again.

00:07:36.920 --> 00:07:39.460
What does she find so amusing?

00:07:39.460 --> 00:07:40.710
I suppose it’s a habit.

00:07:40.710 --> 00:07:43.880
I bet she has no friends.

00:07:43.880 --> 00:07:45.940
What a strange oneechan!

00:07:48.640 --> 00:07:50.600
Shut up, filthy commoners!

00:07:50.600 --> 00:07:54.070
Only Aizawa Minto is my rival!

00:08:01.860 --> 00:08:03.670
Is it okay... to leave her alone?

00:08:04.030 --> 00:08:07.780
Yes, it is. Paying her attention will
just make her more arrogant.

00:08:07.780 --> 00:08:09.070
Are you sure?

00:08:09.070 --> 00:08:10.050
Quite sure.

00:08:11.990 --> 00:08:13.510
Deep down, you know her, right?

00:08:14.290 --> 00:08:18.470
She’s just a spoiled child. She gets
into a fight with me every year.

00:08:19.290 --> 00:08:23.310
Your words seem unkind,
but in your hear you worry about her.

00:08:26.010 --> 00:08:27.310
She might resemble me...

00:08:32.220 --> 00:08:36.780
I see my old self in her,
and it irritates me.

00:08:41.690 --> 00:08:43.980
Hey, hey, where is Minto-san?

00:08:43.980 --> 00:08:45.460
Well, let’s see...

00:08:45.460 --> 00:08:47.630
She went away!

00:08:48.130 --> 00:08:50.210
What the hell!

00:08:50.780 --> 00:08:56.830
What overbearing, arrogant and egotistical conduct!

00:08:56.830 --> 00:09:00.010
Aizawa Minto, I knew you were my rival for life!

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:04.930
Today for sure I’m going to make it clear who is better!

00:09:23.800 --> 00:09:25.410
Hmm...

00:09:34.200 --> 00:09:38.450
My lady, the item you wanted will be here soon.

00:09:38.450 --> 00:09:40.960
I’m glad I got it in time.

00:09:40.960 --> 00:09:42.470
See you later.

00:09:43.750 --> 00:09:45.100
I’ve found you!

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:48.800
You’re plotting something behind my back isn’t it?

00:09:48.800 --> 00:09:50.050
Not at all.

00:09:50.050 --> 00:09:53.320
C’mon, you, spit it out! Hey hey hey!

00:09:51.910 --> 00:09:53.320
She’s lashing out again.

00:09:53.890 --> 00:09:58.570
Hey hey hey! Tell me! Hey hey hey!

00:09:55.470 --> 00:09:58.570
Deep down she wants to be
with Minto-san.

00:09:59.430 --> 00:10:00.610
What’s that?

00:10:00.610 --> 00:10:03.330
Why won’t you tell me?

00:10:00.610 --> 00:10:05.250
Maybe... that’s her way of making friends with Minto...

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:06.830
It’ll be a big weight off your mind
if you tell me...

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:08.960
All right.

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:13.200
So you’re just casually flashing your diamond about, trying to say the right things

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:17.620
and making a appeal with your wealth
because you’re gonna lose to me!

00:10:17.620 --> 00:10:20.500
But there’s no way you can defeat me like that!

00:10:24.180 --> 00:10:25.520
Stop it!

00:10:27.670 --> 00:10:29.980
Do you know what you’re doing?

00:10:31.010 --> 00:10:34.690
S- Sure, I’m fighting...

00:10:35.010 --> 00:10:36.030
You’re a liar!

00:10:36.850 --> 00:10:40.610
You’re just lonely, aren’t you?
You should just admit it.

00:10:41.520 --> 00:10:44.120
Not at all. I’m not lonely...

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:51.030
I’ll tell you this: Nobody will open up to you unless you open yourself up to others.

00:10:52.070 --> 00:10:55.090
What, what are you talking about? I just...

00:10:55.450 --> 00:11:01.370
So, for a start you can stop playing this
stupid game with me, can’t you?

00:11:01.370 --> 00:11:03.460
I am Saionji Kanna.

00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:06.630
I’m a noble daughter of Saionji,
the renowned CEO.

00:11:06.630 --> 00:11:09.020
Why would I have to play games
with the likes of you?

00:11:18.050 --> 00:11:18.760
Baaya!

00:11:18.760 --> 00:11:20.010
My lady!

00:11:20.010 --> 00:11:21.430
Please take care of the guests!

00:11:21.430 --> 00:11:22.660
Certainly.

00:11:24.640 --> 00:11:26.240
What’s up?

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:28.330
Quiche!

00:11:28.900 --> 00:11:29.660
Heh.

00:11:30.520 --> 00:11:35.370
Since Ichigo is here, that must mean
there’s Mew Aqua in that box!

00:11:35.990 --> 00:11:37.210
Mew Aqua...

00:11:38.870 --> 00:11:41.300
...in this box? No way!

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:44.180
I’ve got it!

00:11:45.690 --> 00:11:46.180
Oops!

00:11:49.670 --> 00:11:53.470
Mew Aqua... what a wonderful name!

00:11:53.920 --> 00:11:57.020
It seems to be the kind of thing that
only a real princess could have.

00:11:57.020 --> 00:11:59.860
It’s not like that. Give it back!

00:11:59.860 --> 00:12:02.200
Hrmph! Tough luck!

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:04.870
Hey, don’t be stupid! Give it back!

00:12:04.870 --> 00:12:12.480
No way! I’ll only return it if you admit your defeat to me,

00:12:12.480 --> 00:12:16.380
...the true princess - Saionji Kanna!

00:12:16.700 --> 00:12:20.840
Oy, bitch! Shut up and give me the damn box!

00:12:21.240 --> 00:12:23.550
You called me a bitch! How rude!

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:29.010
For a human, standing against us,
you’re a bit of a wise ass.

00:12:29.540 --> 00:12:32.090
Well, are there any strong spirits here?

00:12:32.800 --> 00:12:33.890
Oh, no!

00:12:36.010 --> 00:12:39.820
Well, what sort of Chimera Anima will this spirit create?

00:12:41.180 --> 00:12:42.600
FUSION!

00:12:56.570 --> 00:12:58.960
Ooh, that’s a good one!

00:13:02.410 --> 00:13:04.420
Everyone has got away.

00:13:06.910 --> 00:13:10.590
What are you doing!
Leave that box and run!

00:13:11.460 --> 00:13:13.060
No I won’t!

00:13:18.380 --> 00:13:19.480
Mew Mew Mint!

00:13:21.220 --> 00:13:23.350
METAMORPHO-SE!

00:13:57.550 --> 00:14:00.150
Quiche! You can’t do what you want any more!

00:14:00.720 --> 00:14:05.150
And now, for the Earth’s future,
I’ll be of service! ~Nya!

00:14:06.010 --> 00:14:07.110
What the...?

00:14:08.520 --> 00:14:11.820
Reborn... Lettuce RUSH!!

00:14:23.280 --> 00:14:26.340
Reborn... Pomegran’ SPEAR!!

00:14:37.090 --> 00:14:38.470
Look out!

00:14:39.010 --> 00:14:43.560
Reborn... PuddingRings INFERNO!!

00:14:49.560 --> 00:14:50.660
(No effect!)

00:14:50.660 --> 00:14:52.820
Ekkk, too strong!

00:14:55.770 --> 00:14:57.410
Now, make your escape!

00:14:57.860 --> 00:15:00.330
I-I’ll never run away before you do!

00:15:03.320 --> 00:15:05.670
Cut it out! Do you want to die?

00:15:08.160 --> 00:15:09.680
Minto-san...

00:15:20.500 --> 00:15:23.220
Ack! Eeeeak~!!

00:15:21.840 --> 00:15:24.230
I can’t breathe! Get off me!

00:15:26.510 --> 00:15:27.390
Minto...

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:37.820
It’s gonna shoot..

00:15:49.020 --> 00:15:50.090
Blue Knight!

00:15:51.890 --> 00:15:52.550
Ichigo!

00:15:53.910 --> 00:15:54.800
Not him again!

00:15:55.240 --> 00:15:57.140
(Shut up!)

00:15:58.630 --> 00:16:01.840
In its mouth,
aim when its mouth is open.

00:16:03.150 --> 00:16:03.770
Minto!

00:16:04.420 --> 00:16:05.230
Mew Strawberry!

00:16:07.470 --> 00:16:08.280
I’ll open its mouth!

00:16:08.590 --> 00:16:09.200
OK!

00:16:09.850 --> 00:16:11.080
Nyan!

00:16:11.890 --> 00:16:12.490
Nyaa!

00:16:15.640 --> 00:16:17.690
MintonArrow!

00:16:23.990 --> 00:16:27.460
Reborn... Mint ECHO!!

00:16:36.830 --> 00:16:37.790
We did it!

00:16:37.790 --> 00:16:39.290
Good combination.

00:16:39.290 --> 00:16:40.060
Mew Strawberry!

00:16:57.140 --> 00:16:59.690
Reborn... Strawberry SURPRISE!!

00:17:08.240 --> 00:17:09.870
Retrieving! Retrieving!

00:17:18.620 --> 00:17:21.470
Oh well, not a Mew Aqua...

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:29.230
That was fantastic!

00:17:30.890 --> 00:17:33.740
You should become mine!

00:17:34.100 --> 00:17:35.200
Uh...

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:38.680
I’ll pay whatever you want.
So let me...

00:17:38.680 --> 00:17:40.820
Money can’t buy friendship.

00:17:41.310 --> 00:17:42.160
What?

00:17:43.310 --> 00:17:46.530
I’m afraid you don’t understand at all..

00:17:46.980 --> 00:17:51.450
There’s something you can never get
unless you open your heart.

00:17:59.250 --> 00:18:03.170
Why? I’ve always got everything I ever wanted...

00:18:03.750 --> 00:18:08.520
My father and mother bought me
everything... even my friends.

00:18:12.260 --> 00:18:18.020
<i>No! This isn’t what I want!</i>

00:18:22.480 --> 00:18:27.120
But... Aizawa Minto was different from the others...

00:18:27.860 --> 00:18:28.580
<i>Hmmf!</i>

00:18:29.740 --> 00:18:32.410
So I’ve always envied you.

00:18:34.820 --> 00:18:36.710
But tell me, how do I open my heart?

00:18:38.160 --> 00:18:40.710
Great! The contents are undamaged!

00:18:41.710 --> 00:18:43.540
What is this?

00:18:43.540 --> 00:18:44.710
Tea.

00:18:44.710 --> 00:18:45.480
Tea?

00:18:45.920 --> 00:18:49.670
Yes. I ordered it for you all.

00:18:49.670 --> 00:18:50.440
Would you like some?

00:18:50.440 --> 00:18:51.650
Of course!

00:18:54.340 --> 00:18:56.510
Please help yourself.

00:18:56.510 --> 00:18:58.020
Thanks!

00:18:56.510 --> 00:18:58.020
Itadakimasu!

00:18:58.810 --> 00:19:01.430
I find tea very relaxing.

00:19:01.430 --> 00:19:02.520
I agree.

00:19:02.520 --> 00:19:05.320
Teacakes taste good, too!

00:19:06.110 --> 00:19:07.990
Bu-Ling, you’re spilling tea!

00:19:09.980 --> 00:19:12.790
How about tea?
Why don’t you join us?

00:19:15.240 --> 00:19:17.410
Erm... l don’t drink things like that...

00:19:17.410 --> 00:19:18.380
Come on!

00:19:22.620 --> 00:19:24.750
Go ahead, it’s delicious.

00:19:24.750 --> 00:19:26.290
I told you, I don’t drink such...

00:19:26.290 --> 00:19:28.140
Please eat the teacake!

00:19:34.220 --> 00:19:35.650
It’s delicious, isn’t it?

00:19:40.600 --> 00:19:42.700
It tastes so terrible I can’t drink it!

00:19:46.440 --> 00:19:51.110
Next time I’ll let you have much
more delicious tea at my party!

00:19:51.110 --> 00:19:53.880
So... you’re going to invite me to your party?

00:19:53.880 --> 00:19:55.420
Um... er...

00:19:56.410 --> 00:19:59.470
Of course! I’d invite you even if you didn’t ask...

00:20:01.870 --> 00:20:05.880
...because you’re my eternal rival!

00:20:25.500 --> 00:20:28.040
Bu-Ling has a fiancé? What?!

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:31.380
It took me ages to get to be Aoyama-kun’s girlfriend,

00:20:31.380 --> 00:20:33.800
but Bu-Ling has a fiancé already?!
She doesn’t even know about love!

00:20:33.800 --> 00:20:36.050
Something wrong with the konnyaku shop?

00:20:36.050 --> 00:20:39.310
Bu-Ling doesn’t understand what you’re talking about!

00:20:39.310 --> 00:20:43.060
Next: “A Fiancé Appears! Bu-Ling’s fated marriage”

00:20:43.060 --> 00:20:45.850
Hey, your fiancé is chasing you again!

00:20:45.850 --> 00:20:48.400
Argh, that konnyaku seller is a nuisance!

00:20:48.400 --> 00:20:50.570
I don’t want any konnyaku.

00:20:50.570 --> 00:20:52.700
Oh, I just can’t accept this!
